+  /* to do all of its work.                                                */
+  /*                                                                       */
+  /* This must be greater than 4KByte if you use FreeType to rasterize     */
+  /* glyphs; otherwise, you may set it to zero to avoid unnecessary        */
+  /* allocation of the render pool.                                        */
