+  /*                                                                       */
+  /*   FreeType can be compiled in debug or trace mode.  In debug mode,    */
+  /*   errors are reported through the `ftdebug' component.  In trace      */
+  /*   mode, additional messages are sent to the standard output during    */
+  /*   execution.                                                          */
